    {
      "id": "biceps/ez-bar-biceps-curl-with-arm-blaster",
      "slug": "ez-bar-biceps-curl-with-arm-blaster",
      "name": "曲杆二头弯举臂强化",
      "muscle": "biceps",
      "bodyPart": "arms",
      "equipment": "ez-bar",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "forearms"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "给曲杆装上合适的重量，握住让手腕舒适的弯曲部分。",
        "将肘部钉在体侧——想象它们被钉住了。只有前臂在动。",
        "用力收紧二头肌将重量弯举上来。在顶部，像挤橙汁一样挤压后再下放。",
        "缓慢用3秒下放，在每一厘米对抗重力。手腕保持像钢棒一样笔直。如果身体摇晃，重量太大了。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "biceps/ez-bar-biceps-curl-with-arm-blaster.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/biceps/ez-bar-biceps-curl-with-arm-blaster.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/biceps/ez-bar-biceps-curl-with-arm-blaster.thumb.webp"
    },
    {
      "id": "biceps/ez-bar-seated-close-grip-concentration-curl",
      "slug": "ez-bar-seated-close-grip-concentration-curl",
      "name": "曲杆坐姿窄握集中弯举",
      "muscle": "biceps",
      "bodyPart": "arms",
      "equipment": "ez-bar",
      "category": "strength",
      "secondaryMuscles": [
        "forearms"
      ],
      "instructions": [
        "给曲杆装上合适的重量，握住让手腕舒适的弯曲部分。",
        "挺直坐好，背部挺直，双脚平放在地面。",
        "使用窄握，双手间距约15厘米，将重点转向内侧。",
        "双腿分开坐下，将工作臂的后侧靠在大腿内侧。这锁定了上臂。",
        "缓慢弯举重量，完全专注于二头肌的收缩。在顶部像挤橙汁一样挤压。",
        "用3秒下放并完全伸展。你的大腿就是护栏——不可能摆动。",
        "呼吸：发力时呼气，回程时吸气。进行大重量复合动作时，深吸一口气到腹部，在最难的部分保持住。"
      ],
      "file": "biceps/ez-bar-seated-close-grip-concentration-curl.gif",
      "gifUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/biceps/ez-bar-seated-close-grip-concentration-curl.gif",
      "thumbUrl": "https://jahelcuadrado.github.io/ExerciseGymGigsDB/biceps/ez-bar-seated-close-grip-concentration-curl.thumb.webp"
    },
